# The blanket `.*` above hides every *new* dotfile, which is how .editorconfig and
# .gitattributes were invisible to `git status` until they were exempted by name.
# These files are listed so a replacement cannot be added and silently ignored.
!.clang-format
!.editorconfig
!.gitattributes
*.log
*.log_*
logs_*
*.patch
!patches/**/*.patch
!ecosystem/**/*.patch
*.diff
*.yuv
*.h264
*.pcapng
*.pcap
*.raw
*.dat
html/
test.*
build/
out*
assets/
